WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,790
This is my home

2
00:00:00,840 --> 00:00:02,360
It's being renovated inside now

3
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:05,320
You see, it takes manpower to move these things. How much do you give me, sir?

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,800
We had someone look at it before

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,160
It cost 2,500 to move everything up.

6
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:10,760
Then we have two thousand lines

7
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,240
All two thousand will be moved to your house.

8
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:16,200
Two thousand is just two thousand, the old man is in charge of the food and doesn’t care about the food.

9
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,400
I want to eat a box lunch

10
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:20,680
It's the kind of businessman sent over by a man in a yellow robe.

11
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:23,680
Is it okay for him to eat one portion alone? At least three portions are fine.

12
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,800
You must be full when you eat, don’t eat a box lunch

13
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,920
We have a small shop down there

14
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:29,320
I'll ask them to cook some vegetables for you then and you can eat over there.

15
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,560
Eat as much as you want

16
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,680
If you do things for me, you must have enough to eat.

17
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:34,120
If you don't even have enough to eat,

18
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,720
Why do I have the nerve to let you do things?

19
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,080
Then work

20
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:38,480
But this thing of mine is not light.

21
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,840
You have to keep an eye on yourselves.

22
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,360
Help me move everyone upstairs

23
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:44,730
No problem

24
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:47,600
Bring me another box of tiles and come back

25
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:52,700
Is this right?

26
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,740
Brother is so awesome
